1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Module Room

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Sun Wukong

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,880
Mojo-mojo-mojo spy

4
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,900
Mojo-mojo-mojo spy

5
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:21,000
Mojo-mojo-mojo spy

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Mojo spy

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,120
This world is colorful and charming, truth and lies confuse our eyes.

8
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:36,120
Look with your heart and you'll see, the truth is never far away.

9
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:42,140
Hey you, good or bad, truth or lies, can't escape the smoke of the soul.

10
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:48,159
Take all your courage, maybe you can save this world.

11
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,760
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

12
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:53,880
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

13
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:56,840
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

14
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,100
Mojo Spy

15
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:11,640
In the previous episode...

16
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:16,040
Tuna Town's richest man, Ye Yongfu's daughter, vanished mysteriously.

17
00:01:16,439 --> 00:01:17,719
To find his daughter,

18
00:01:17,719 --> 00:01:21,179
He hired Jimmy Chen, Locky Qi, and Hawxing.

19
00:01:21,179 --> 00:01:23,079
They investigated the castle.

20
00:01:23,079 --> 00:01:27,459
In Princess Ye's room,

21
00:01:27,459 --> 00:01:31,400
Locky Qi found a mysterious email from someone named Nintendough

22
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:33,759
On the computer.

23
00:01:33,759 --> 00:01:36,180
The Real and Fake Princess

24
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:42,299
What happened?

25
00:01:42,299 --> 00:01:46,739
Hawxing suddenly fainted with a thud while working just now.

26
00:01:46,740 --> 00:01:50,060
Now I can only rely on you to find my daughter

27
00:01:50,060 --> 00:01:52,160
Is Hawxing okay

28
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:55,380
He might have fainted from exhaustion

29
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:58,560
He's been sent to the guest room to rest

30
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:01,140
Heh heh, who told him to always grab the spotlight?

31
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,200
Karma, huh?

32
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:02,960
Locky Qi

33
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:06,900
Lord Ye

34
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:08,219
Don't worry

35
00:02:08,219 --> 00:02:10,060
We've already found some clues

36
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:10,960
Really?

37
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:13,960
The Queen malfunctioned for only five minutes

38
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:16,200
And from the main door to Princess Ye's room

39
00:02:16,199 --> 00:02:17,839
it takes at least seven minutes at best

40
00:02:17,839 --> 00:02:20,099
Plus there are no signs of struggle in the room

41
00:02:20,099 --> 00:02:21,819
The kidnapper couldn't possibly

42
00:02:21,819 --> 00:02:23,979
have completed the kidnapping in such a short time

43
00:02:23,979 --> 00:02:24,959
So then

44
00:02:24,959 --> 00:02:27,019
there's only one possibility

45
00:02:27,019 --> 00:02:30,000
Your daughter went out and got herself kidnapped

46
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:30,479
What?

47
00:02:30,479 --> 00:02:31,399
That's impossible

48
00:02:31,399 --> 00:02:33,139
Ye is always a good kid

49
00:02:33,139 --> 00:02:35,719
We found an email on her computer that

50
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:37,319
she didn't have time to delete

51
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:38,659
It says here

52
00:02:38,659 --> 00:02:41,379
Princess Ye was planning to run away from home all along.

53
00:02:41,379 --> 00:02:42,780
And I bet

54
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:45,019
the Queen and all the Ye family robots got poisoned

55
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:46,380
because of her.

56
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:47,840
No way.

57
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,800
She doesn't have that kind of knowledge.

58
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:52,100
She doesn't have that kind of knowledge.

59
00:02:52,100 --> 00:02:53,500
But the person who sent the email

60
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:55,080
is probably some virus expert.

61
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:57,260
If they teamed up with Princess Ye from the inside,

62
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:59,660
then the virus could easily break in.

63
00:02:59,660 --> 00:03:02,160
Well... that's possible.

64
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:04,460
Little Ye may be well-behaved,

65
00:03:04,460 --> 00:03:07,180
but she's always resented the Queen

66
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:08,300
having her mother's personality.

67
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:12,640
I should have had the Queen monitor her emails.

68
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,379
Monitor?

69
00:03:13,379 --> 00:03:15,199
This isn't a prison, you know.

70
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:15,879
What did you say?

71
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:18,120
Nothing, nothing!

72
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,400
I mean, if there *was* monitoring,

73
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,900
this wouldn't have happened.

74
00:03:20,900 --> 00:03:23,699
You... you're Locky Qi, right?

75
00:03:23,699 --> 00:03:26,500
Can you find out where Ye went?

76
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:28,079
Now we've got an email address.

77
00:03:28,079 --> 00:03:30,740
Let the queen review the email source through the server.

78
00:03:30,740 --> 00:03:32,400
Then we'll know where that online friend is.

79
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,500
I think I found her.

80
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:35,659
Then we’ll have a clue to your daughter’s whereabouts.

81
00:03:35,659 --> 00:03:36,439
Found it.

82
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:38,879
Mail from 69 Hailingtian, Tuna Town

83
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:40,180
A man named Nintendough.

84
00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:41,699
So what are we waiting for?

85
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:44,140
Wait, Locky Qi.

86
00:03:44,140 --> 00:03:47,600
We still don't know what Princess Ye looks like.

87
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:50,080
Please give us a photo for our investigation.

88
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,800
Hold on.

89
00:03:51,800 --> 00:04:02,400
Coming, coming!

90
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:05,660
Is Nintendough at home?

91
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:08,120
I am. Who are you?

92
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:10,140
I'm private detective Jimmy Chen.

93
00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:11,400
Entrusted by someone.

94
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,920
Coming to investigate.

95
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:15,920
Excuse me, do you know Princess Ye?

96
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:17,540
I don't know.

97
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:20,540
Really?

98
00:04:20,540 --> 00:04:23,980
Why are there emails from you on Ye's computer?

99
00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:27,520
You also wrote the virus in Ye's main computer, didn't you?

100
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:29,939
No, that's not it.

101
00:04:29,939 --> 00:04:33,759
I didn't write a virus. The virus crashed the Queen system.

102
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:36,240
I never mentioned the Queen, you did.

103
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,180
Guilty conscience.

104
00:04:37,180 --> 00:04:37,740
Spill it.

105
00:04:37,740 --> 00:04:38,620
What else do you know?

106
00:04:38,620 --> 00:04:41,780
I know she wanted to run away from home.

107
00:04:41,780 --> 00:04:45,300
She asked me to find a computer whiz to make a virus.

108
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:47,259
Where is Princess Ye now?

109
00:04:47,259 --> 00:04:49,680
I heard him mention Tuna Town Hotel.

110
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:51,379
She might be staying there.

111
00:04:51,379 --> 00:04:55,019
I'm warning you—

112
00:04:55,019 --> 00:04:57,360
If we don't find her, you're under arrest.

113
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:10,740
Sorry.

114
00:05:10,740 --> 00:05:12,300
Miss Ye has already checked out.

115
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:17,379
Hey, is this Detective Jimmy Chen?

116
00:05:17,379 --> 00:05:18,920
My daughter is back home already.

117
00:05:24,139 --> 00:05:25,199
If it weren't for you,

118
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:28,199
my daughter wouldn't have come home safely.

119
00:05:28,199 --> 00:05:30,160
What's going on?

120
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:34,500
Let me explain.

121
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:37,360
I planned this kidnapping myself.

122
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,800
The goal was to test if Dad still cared about me.

123
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,720
Then I found out from Nintendough

124
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:44,080
that he hired the best detective to search everywhere for me.

125
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:45,160
I got what I wanted.

126
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,580
just returned to my father's side

127
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:48,860
Such a strange idea

128
00:05:48,860 --> 00:05:50,040
Ye

129
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:52,199
Father has been too strict with you before

130
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:53,280
It's all my fault

131
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,759
Please don't do this again

132
00:05:54,759 --> 00:05:56,699
You're my only daughter

133
00:05:56,699 --> 00:05:59,180
Huh? When did your hands get so rough?

134
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:02,080
From practicing the piano

135
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,620
You never paid attention

136
00:06:03,620 --> 00:06:06,420
You only looked at the queen and missed Mother

137
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:07,860
I'm sorry

138
00:06:07,860 --> 00:06:09,540
But you need to know

139
00:06:09,540 --> 00:06:11,460
You and the queen, in my heart—

140
00:06:11,460 --> 00:06:13,160
—are equally important

141
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:13,800
No, no

142
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,180
From today on

143
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:16,660
You are the most important

144
00:06:16,660 --> 00:06:19,200
Since everything has been resolved

145
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:21,319
Then we'll take our leave

146
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:22,140
Please wait

147
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:23,720
You must stay

148
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:24,600
for a simple meal

149
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:27,340
And I heard Detective Hawxing say

150
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:29,639
your computer skills are also impressive

151
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:30,840
不敢当

152
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:32,800
有什么事需要我帮忙吗

153
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,639
是这样

154
00:06:33,639 --> 00:06:34,800
霍侦探发现

155
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,500
主电脑中有病毒残留

156
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:38,500
但他现在身体不舒服

157
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:40,020
无法帮助皇后

158
00:06:40,020 --> 00:06:42,720
所以想请你帮忙

159
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,460
难得见霍星会求人

160
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:46,400
我希望你能留下来

161
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:48,699
相信今晚会有一顿美味的大餐

162
00:06:48,699 --> 00:06:52,220
失败者还这么嚣张

163
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:53,240
对不起

164
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,900
我先回房间休息了

165
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:11,780
切断和叶家局域网的联系

166
00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:16,220
开始分析病毒

167
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:23,100
果然

168
00:07:23,100 --> 00:07:27,019
陈侦探

169
00:07:27,019 --> 00:07:29,939
没想到你这个小外甥这么厉害

170
00:07:29,939 --> 00:07:31,800
真是英雄出少年

171
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,519
那当然

172
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:45,579
你这个笨蛋

173
00:07:45,579 --> 00:07:54,240
这可是妈妈送给我的晚礼服

174
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:54,699
我

175
00:07:54,699 --> 00:07:57,319
好了好了

176
00:07:57,319 --> 00:07:58,180
Ye

177
00:07:58,180 --> 00:07:59,279
Don't lose your cool.

178
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:00,839
Finally made it back.

179
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:03,180
Let's have a nice family reunion dinner!

180
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:04,439
Sorry.

181
00:08:04,439 --> 00:08:06,579
I... I'll head to my room and rest.

182
00:08:26,379 --> 00:08:27,399
It's so late.

183
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:29,019
What are you doing here?

184
00:08:29,019 --> 00:08:31,720
I should be the one asking you that.

185
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,320
Miss Ye

186
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,680
What are you doing?

187
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:34,900
Mind your own business.

188
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:37,460
You're not Princess Ye at all.

189
00:08:37,460 --> 00:08:39,460
Ye Chengzhu is blind in both eyes.

190
00:08:39,460 --> 00:08:40,120
Can't recognize you.

191
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,180
You're using a virus too.

192
00:08:41,180 --> 00:08:42,680
Destroy the queen's identification system.

193
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:44,120
And the calluses on your hands.

194
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,720
And definitely not from piano practice.

195
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,720
It's from practicing with your weapon on your waist, isn't it?

196
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,180
Say.

197
00:08:48,180 --> 00:08:49,960
Who are you?

198
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,440
Why steal the statue?

199
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,240
Where's the real Princess Ye?

200
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,700
Hmph, that's fine.

201
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:57,200
I still prefer to be straightforward

202
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,800
I am Shaker

203
00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:00,580
A senior executive of The Illumin-Eye

204
00:09:00,580 --> 00:09:02,740
Smashing all obstacles in front of Dottie and me

205
00:09:02,740 --> 00:09:03,960
Is the belief of my life

206
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:06,180
The Illumin-Eye again

207
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:07,460
Who is Dottie?

208
00:09:07,460 --> 00:09:08,780
The leader of your organization?

209
00:09:08,780 --> 00:09:10,540
Dottie

210
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:28,980
What's wrong?

211
00:09:38,980 --> 00:09:40,379
Huh? What's this?

212
00:09:40,379 --> 00:09:43,320
The one you brought back is just a thief

213
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,879
The real Princess Ye's whereabouts are still unknown

214
00:09:45,879 --> 00:09:54,279
[Ending Theme]

215
00:09:54,279 --> 00:09:58,480
Being alone, lonely and solitary

216
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:01,940
At that time, life

217
00:10:01,940 --> 00:10:06,399
Is bound to have some unhappiness

218
00:10:06,399 --> 00:10:09,500
Saying goodbye to today

219
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:13,920
Always makes people feel lost

220
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:17,360
Look at tomorrow

221
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:21,659
Waving to me on your horizon

222
00:10:21,659 --> 00:10:25,379
Every day is just sunrise and sunset

223
00:10:25,379 --> 00:10:29,379
Plunging into time, dreaming more

224
00:10:29,379 --> 00:10:31,919
Anticipate in life

225
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:34,419
Every second, every moment

226
00:10:34,419 --> 00:10:41,139
Bright eyes are sparkling

227
00:10:41,139 --> 00:10:44,519
Smiling into the sunlight

228
00:10:44,519 --> 00:10:47,179
Stepping through the bridge

229
00:10:47,179 --> 00:10:49,740
At the heavy crossroads